300","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1614791798.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ilhEa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40f2c733-03ee-44a7-aeb2-759564f35cbd","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分なら []rune を避けるなら \u003chttps://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf8/\u003e を使うかな…","ts":"1614791764.217700","attachments":[{"fallback":"utf8 - The Go Programming Language","id":1,"title":"utf8 - The Go Programming Language","title_link":"https://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf8/","text":"Go is an open source programming language that makes it easy to build simple, reliable, and efficient software.","blocks":null,"service_name":"golang.org","service_icon":"https://golang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf8/","original_url":"https://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf8/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v0BHZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff2ae9d0-219a-47db-a7ce-1bbf0ce829f4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"string だと文字単位で処理ができないと言う認識なんですが、そんなことはないってことですか? 方法があるなら知りたいです。","ts":"1614791736.217200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tK1Kv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a40d0f94-99f0-4d8e-95be-22ce4a5ce5ac","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Encode かける直前で []rune にすればいいんじゃないんですか?","ts":"1614791701.216700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"03Px"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3b3e311-0859-40a8-94c9-d5bd491305c2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なので今、string を文字単位で処理するために []rune にし、これを map の key にするためにふたたび string にし、最後に書き出す際にエンコードのためにまた []rune に戻す、ということをしています。\n最初から []rune を map の key にできたら、string との変換が2回削減できるのでは? と思ったんですが、Go だと無理そう…? ってなってます。","ts":"1614791653.215900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uV+6="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee9580de-1bf2-4802-90cf-70e445f9485c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"最優的に UTF-16 でエンコードするので\n\u003chttps://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf16/#Encode\u003e\nここで結局 map の key を []rune にする必要があります","ts":"1614791554.212900","attachments":[{"fallback":"utf16 - The Go Programming Language","id":1,"title":"utf16 - The Go Programming Language","title_link":"https://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf16/#Encode","text":"Go is an open source programming language that makes it easy to build simple, reliable, and efficient software.","blocks":null,"service_name":"golang.org","service_icon":"https://golang.org/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf16/#Encode","original_url":"https://golang.org/pkg/unicode/utf16/#Encode"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n5pwh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"589f69b9-72bd-4684-97cf-1271a837d1c1","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"tree的なものを作ろうとしてるんですよねきっと","ts":"1614791532.211700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wzSV="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc0560ea-e642-4d7e-9b8f-bb57e2b00655","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ですよね、そんな気がした。","ts":"1614791519.211200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9vW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5557d2a0-a61f-4947-a9df-63b94b172cb9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私が今作ってるものをご存知なら想像付くかも","ts":"1614791516.211000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vp3P3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a36a7154-42b5-4de6-ae14-edddf2d72ee7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"検索のインデックスです","ts":"1614791506.210500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3rR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d2b4f72-0e5d-4073-8b04-4aa9e7f53ab1","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"そのmapってどんなデータなんでしょう\nちょっと気になる","ts":"1614791470.210100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9pfj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"260c7e97-070c-4b6c-9794-cc47ca718735","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"文字単位で切り取ったものを map の key にしたい","ts":"1614791391.208100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EXg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66a2a2f7-3dc4-4e18-8b96-c06f991f203f","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"n文字目まで、みたいな切り方をするときは[]runeにしますけどね。\n\u003chttps://play.golang.org/p/8u98MvJ8XBd\u003e\n結局そういう「文字単位で処理するときだけ[]runeに変換する」という使い方が多い気がします","ts":"1614791372.207400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K=8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f0faed4-1a5b-4470-91cc-f010c1df7d8f","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"処理するときだけ[]runeとして使っててデータ構造として保持して引き回す事は少ないってことかなと思いました","ts":"1614791343.206600","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1614791356.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HwO4C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e35c810-bf74-479b-b505-d3a6853b372a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あれ、string を文字単位で扱いたい場合は []rune にしろって聞いてたんですけど…ウソ(あるいは古い)情報…?","ts":"1614791190.202800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u+Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6bf3342-eee1-4855-97a4-db726464224a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"[]rune が必要な場面ってそんなにない気がする","ts":"1614791146.201100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L0M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b28d68c-e48c-4057-aff6-c2796edca74a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"for で回すときは別に []rune に変換しなくとも文字ごとに取ってくるし","ts":"1614791135.200500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m4wBq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a09c5c5-26e1-4f78-a269-37d19eb3dbd4","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"完全に興味本位ですが、go書いてて[]runeをそんな長いライフサイクルで使うシーンに遭遇したことがない\n（およそ `string -\u0026gt; （何らかの目的を以て[]runeに変換しないといけない処理）→ string` というケースがほとんど）\nので、thincaさんがどういう文脈なのかちょっと気になっている","ts":"1614791100.199600","edited":{"user":"UGXMRNBUM","ts":"1614791193.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f81558cd-cf2c-40dc-bc36-643a8017e2e3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"rune 単位で扱いたいんですけど、他に持ち方ってあるんでしょうか?","ts":"1614791098.199500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qaKW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43f3646c-0701-4ef2-8726-d8c34923d847","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"[]rune でもつのをやめるとか。","ts":"1614791079.198900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QYFK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a00d82d-16d8-450a-aac8-7aab2ba27c43","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ふーむ、めちゃくちゃ無駄だけど string に変換するしかなさそうですね…","ts":"1614791050.198400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J0t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93e1f8e1-cb1d-4b51-b3a5-8056e97454a9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"長さは固定ですね…","ts":"1614791017.197600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"STTw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"560d7d8b-d28b-4dbe-8ebb-196a1a271489","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"型自体に要素数が入っていたような。長さは可変にしたいのです","ts":"1614791008.197200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pan"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3312c24-6975-4c6a-96e3-8949208ef6ca","type":"message","user":"U0